  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"uf058017a\" id=\"uf058017a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8dbbf08c\" id=\"u8dbbf08c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">1.信号和槽简介</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue1fbb84f\" id=\"ue1fbb84f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u4ee0c30d\" id=\"u4ee0c30d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">信号和槽机制是 QT 的核心机制，应用于对象之间的通信<br />●信号和槽是用来在对象间传递数据的方法<br />●当一个特定事件发生的时候，signal会被emit出来，slot调用是用来响应相应的signal的<br />●Qt中对象已经包含了许多预定义的 signal（基本组件都有各自特有的预定义的信号）<br />●槽函数绑定了信号，信号一旦发出，就会自动调用绑定的槽函数<br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaf9b1f89\" id=\"uaf9b1f89\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">2.信号和槽绑定</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud44c3c17\" id=\"ud44c3c17\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u53c3379e\" id=\"u53c3379e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">通过调用 QObject 对象的 connect 函数来将对象的信号与另外一个对象的槽函数相关联，当发射者发射信号时，接收者的槽函数将被调用<br /><br />点击按钮，输出hello</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20PyQt5.QtWidgets%20import%20QApplication%2C%20QWidget%2C%20QPushButton%5Cnimport%20sys%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E6%A7%BD%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cndef%20click()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print('hello1')%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23%201.%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%5Cnapp%20%3D%20QApplication(sys.argv)%5Cn%5Cn%23%202.%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%5Cnw%20%3D%20QWidget()%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98%5Cnw.setWindowTitle('%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E5%92%8C%E6%A7%BD%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%91%E5%AE%9A')%5Cn%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22------------------%20%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%20------------------%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cnbtn%20%3D%20QPushButton()%5Cnbtn.setText('%E7%82%B9%E6%88%91')%5Cnbtn.setParent(w)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E7%BB%91%E5%AE%9A%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%E7%82%B9%E5%87%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E6%A7%BD%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22------------------%20%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F1%EF%BC%9A%E6%A7%BD%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%20------------------%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%23%20clicked%20%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%5Cn%23%20click%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E7%9A%84%E6%A7%BD%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnbtn.clicked.connect(click)%5Cn%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22------------------%20%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F2%EF%BC%9A%E6%A7%BD%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8lambda%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F%20------------------%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%23%20%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E5%92%8C%E6%A7%BD%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E8%A6%81%E4%BF%9D%E6%8C%81%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%5Cn%23%20%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E6%9C%89%3D%20%20%20%E6%A7%BD%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%A8%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%5Cnbtn.clicked.connect(lambda%3A%20print('hello2'))%5Cn%5Cn%23%203.%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%5Cnw.show()%5Cn%5Cn%23%204.%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%5Cnsys.exit(app.exec())%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wJexB%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uea779fe5\" id=\"uea779fe5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u52297521\" id=\"u52297521\">运行程序:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u42973128\" id=\"u42973128\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1685238272857-41ad80a5-a6d8-44ea-a6a6-35558592bad9.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u23b0e65e-199f-495e-bef6-fa5e12a8e0c%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0c8b8f26-3415-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A513.6%2C%22height%22%3A282%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A13812%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A642%2C%22originHeight%22%3A353%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%20%E5%8F%91%E5%B0%84%20C%3A%5C%5CUSERS%5C%5CPOPLAR%5C%5CAPPDATA%5C%5CLOCAL%5C%5CPROGRAMS%5C%5CPYTHON%5C%5CPYTHON39%5C%5CPY%20HELLO1%20HELLO2%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A35%2C%22y%22%3A12%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A15%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A16%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%91%E5%B0%84%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A12%2C%22y%22%3A266%2C%22width%22%3A628%2C%22height%22%3A21%2C%22text%22%3A%22C%3A%5C%5CUSERS%5C%5CPOPLAR%5C%5CAPPDATA%5C%5CLOCAL%5C%5CPROGRAMS%5C%5CPYTHON%5C%5CPYTHON39%5C%5CPY%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A13%2C%22y%22%3A299%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A17%2C%22text%22%3A%22HELLO1%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A14%2C%22y%22%3A328%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A17%2C%22text%22%3A%22HELLO2%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%239d8161%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u821a95ff%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"rubOU\" id=\"rubOU\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0d5491b\" id=\"ua0d5491b\">3. 使用PyQt的槽函数</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u0786d8b4\" id=\"u0786d8b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5dec6f7a\" id=\"u5dec6f7a\">利用系统自带退出函数</span><code data-lake-id=\"ue23468ea\" id=\"ue23468ea\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2c8fe39\" id=\"ub2c8fe39\">QApplication.quit</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubc578ee5\" id=\"ubc578ee5\">点击按钮，关闭窗口</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20PyQt5.QtWidgets%20import%20*%5Cnfrom%20PyQt5.QtCore%20import%20*%5Cnfrom%20PyQt5.QtGui%20import%20QIcon%5Cnimport%20sys%5Cn%5Cn%23%201.%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%5Cnapp%20%3D%20QApplication(sys.argv)%5Cn%5Cn%23%202.%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%5Cnw%20%3D%20QWidget()%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98%5Cnw.setWindowTitle('%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%9A%84%E6%A7%BD%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0')%5Cn%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22------------------%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%20------------------%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cnbtn%20%3D%20QPushButton()%5Cnbtn.setText('%E5%85%B3%E9%97%AD%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3')%5Cn%23%20%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%5Cnbtn.setParent(w)%5Cn%5Cn%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22------------------%20%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E5%92%8C%E6%A7%BD%E7%BB%91%E5%AE%9A%20------------------%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cnbtn.clicked.connect(QApplication.quit)%20%20%23%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8QApplication%E7%9A%84quit%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%5Cn%5Cn%23%203.%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%5Cnw.show()%5Cn%5Cn%23%204.%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%5Cnsys.exit(app.exec())%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fvXaw%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card>",
